WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.003
The complete Learning Skill starts with the assigned book, Andrea’s goal and a short study budget.

00:00:06.003 --> 00:00:13.337
Andrea answers first; the chat then provides chapter-linked study files and two short review sessions.

00:00:13.337 --> 00:00:19.803
The corrected kit starts with three cards due out of three total cards.

00:00:19.803 --> 00:00:26.324
Reveal shows the answer, chapter reference and recall-rating controls.

00:00:26.324 --> 00:00:32.375
After Good, the next card appears and the due count falls from three to two.

00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:42.837
The quiz accepts a correct answer and explains it with a chapter reference.
